## Interface: 16001
## Title: RollFrames
## Notes: Group loot rolls, live, in a Blizzard-style window: how many chose Need, Greed or Pass, your own roll, the winner (hover for everyone's rolls), and a saved history. Optional Need/Greed/Pass buttons. Light enough for 40-man raid nights.
